flowchart TB
  User[浏览器用户]
  subgraph View[现状：界面与编排混合]
    Router[App 与 BrowserRouter]
    Home[HomePage]
    Offers[OffersPage 状态与表单]
    Compare[ComparePage 状态与评分展示]
    Settings[SettingsPage 文件操作与政策展示]
    Router --> Home
    Router --> Offers
    Router --> Compare
    Router --> Settings
  end
  subgraph Domain[现状：TypeScript 模型与函数式引擎]
    Types[core/types.ts]
    Calc[calculateOffer]
    Salary[工资聚合]
    Insurance[缴费计算]
    Tax[年度税额]
    Rank[compareOffers]
    Calc --> Salary
    Calc --> Insurance
    Calc --> Tax
  end
  subgraph Infra[现状：浏览器基础设施与静态政策]
    DB[storage/db.ts]
    IDB[(IndexedDB offers 与 drafts)]
    IO[storage/io.ts JSON 与 CSV]
    Files[用户文件]
    Policies[2025 地区与税务示例]
    DB --> IDB
    IO --> Files
  end
  User --> Router
  Offers --> Calc
  Compare --> Calc
  Compare --> Rank
  Offers --> DB
  Compare --> DB
  Settings --> DB
  Settings --> IO
  Compare --> IO
  Settings --> Policies
  Calc --> Policies
  Types -. 类型约束 .-> Calc
  Types -. 类型约束 .-> DB
